    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Tamil Bible 1.0 — a completely free, offline Bible app.\n\n• Two Tamil texts: Thiruviviliam (BSI Tamil, 2012) and IRV Easy Tamil — switch with one tap\n• All 66 books\n• No ads, no account, no tracking — the app itself never uses the internet\n• Highlights, bookmarks, notes and reading progress are stored only on your phone\n\nBible text licenses: Thiruviviliam — Tamil Ecumenical Bible 2012, digitized (Unlicense); Indian Revised Version (IRV) — CC BY-SA 4.0.</string>

